        "id": 226102,
        "name": "FearLord",
        "username": "FearLord",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/5f8ce5/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-03-25T08:52:15.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>As for the Scions, they have a difficulty ranking in the rule book between 1 - 3. Arguably Voss should be ranked higher than 3, as he’s pretty difficult to deal with early game and adds a whole extra wrinkle to the late game.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Faultless, Empyron and Sanction are the easiest 3 Scions. Faultless in particular can be a massive asset when flipped providing lots of healing and Power plays to the heroes, potentially for a while if you can keep him in play.</p>",
