        "created_at": "2019-03-27T17:51:21.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I've had as few as 4 of them show up in one game.&nbsp; Voidsoul, Faultless, Nixious, and Progeny in my last game (and Progeny came out so late he died before getting a second turn).&nbsp; Since you are allowed to stack the deck, I definitely think it matters.</p>",
